WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:09.904
I go to the barbershop.

2
00:00:09.905 --> 00:00:13.625
I get a haircut.

3
00:00:13.626 --> 00:00:16.128
I go to the post office.

4
00:00:16.129 --> 00:00:20.715
I mail my letters.

5
00:00:20.716 --> 00:00:23.487
I go to the fire station.

6
00:00:23.488 --> 00:00:27.851
I learn about safety.

7
00:00:27.852 --> 00:00:31.211
I go to the library.

8
00:00:31.212 --> 00:00:35.716
I borrow books.

9
00:00:35.717 --> 00:00:38.399
I go to the bakery.

10
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:42.599
I buy some bread.

11
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.309
I go to the grocery store.

12
00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:50.705
I buy some fruits and vegetables.

13
00:00:50.706 --> 00:00:53.190
I go to the pet store.

14
00:00:53.191 --> 00:00:59.034
I buy some dog food.

15
00:00:59.035 --> 00:01:04.661
"Whew! What a busy day!"
